# Local dev: copy to model/.env.server (gitignored). SUPABASE_URL should match VITE_SUPABASE_URL in root .env.
#
# Cloud / CI: set the same two names on the host instead of using this file.
# Process env always wins; set SKIP_ENV_SERVER_FILE=1 to ignore this file entirely.
#
# Lovable Cloud Secrets are injected into Lovable Edge Functions (and similar), not
# into a separate Python process. To run this FastAPI app without a local file,
# deploy it (Railway, Render, Fly, Docker, etc.) and add these secrets there, or
# move persist logic into an Edge Function that reads Deno.env.

SUPABASE_URL="https://jyzzceseztsujhlvzzpv.supabase.co"
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY="REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY"
